\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Concept-Guided Chain-of-Thought (CGCoT) Prompting for Item Difficulty Assessment. Each item is processed through a sequence of four prompts, each targeting a different facet of the latent construct of interest, here item difficulty. The LLM's responses are concatenated and fed into the next prompt, culminating in a comprehensive analysis of the item's difficulty before pairwise comparisons are made.}}{4}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
